spyglass_call_queue_depth gauge {}
    Finished calls waiting for the batch writer.
spyglass_calls_dropped_total counter {reason}
    Finished calls dropped before they were written, by reason (queue_full, shutdown, unwritable). Should stay zero.
spyglass_config_reloads_total counter {result}
    Config reloads by result (success, failure). A failure keeps the previous snapshot.
spyglass_inflight_streams gauge {}
    Streaming requests being forwarded now.
spyglass_live_events_dropped_total counter {}
    Live-tail events lost by subscribers that read too slowly.
spyglass_proxy_overhead_seconds histogram {}
    Seconds from request arrival to the upstream request headers being written.
spyglass_request_duration_seconds histogram {}
    Seconds from the start of the upstream exchange to the end of the response.
spyglass_requests_total counter {error_class,family,provider,status}
    Forwarded calls that finished, by family, provider, HTTP status and error class.
spyglass_retention_deleted_total counter {}
    Rows the retention job deleted from calls and tool_events since start.
spyglass_retention_last_run_timestamp_seconds gauge {}
    Unix time the last retention run finished without error; 0 before the first run.
spyglass_ttft_seconds histogram {}
    Seconds from the start of the upstream exchange to the first content of the response.
spyglass_writer_errors_total counter {}
    Failed batch writes to the store.
spyglass_writer_systematic_failure gauge {}
    1 while the writer holds a batch in which every record failed as unwritable, else 0. Should stay zero.
